Chapter: PlugShowReal
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 `show` on a Real. The zig plug refuses it -- judge/Grade.codex is built around
 the refusal, and PORTING_NOTES D12 is the note -- so this probe is here to ask
 what the WASM plug does with the same source, which is a question the safari
 port never gets to ask.

 We say:

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("half   = " & show 0.5)
    print-line-uni ("third  = " & show (1.0 / 3.0))
    print-line-uni ("negone = " & show (0.0 - 1.0))
  end
